# Phase 3 – Project Design

## System Design

The project uses the ServiceNow Incident Management module.

## Main Components

1. Incident Form
2. Client Script
3. UI Policy
4. UI Policy Action
5. User Input

## Workflow

User opens Incident Form
        ↓
User enters/selects Incident details
        ↓
Client Script / UI Policy checks conditions
        ↓
Field behavior changes dynamically
        ↓
User submits Incident
        ↓
Incident is created/updated

## Client Script

Client Scripts are used to execute JavaScript on the client side of a ServiceNow form.

## UI Policy

UI Policies are used to dynamically control form fields without writing complex JavaScript.

## Design Goal

The design provides a simple and dynamic Incident form experience.
